OL,3,GNEWSAFatal caravan assault leads to
OL,4,Amurder arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 39-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fthe suspicion of murder following a
OL,8,Ffatal assault at a caravan park.
OL,10,FEssex Police said it was called to the
OL,11,FValley Road Caravan Park, in
OL,12,FClacton-on-Sea, following reports of a
OL,13,Fman making threats at about 21:15 BST
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FOfficers said a man in his 40s, from
OL,17,FFrinton-on-Sea, was found injured
OL,18,Finside a caravan and pronounced dead at
OL,19,Fthe scene.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
